WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,880
Young man, why are you renting my yard to collect trash?

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:04,440
Also, I just do hard work.

3
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:06,120
Looking for a quieter environment

4
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:07,720
When you are free, you can collect some garbage

5
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:09,920
When there is work, you can go to the city to work

6
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:11,360
Your yard looks quite big to me

7
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:13,640
And it’s okay if people can live in it, right?

8
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:15,240
I don't have very high requirements for these

9
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:17,280
How much does it cost? How can we rent it? You see?

10
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:18,480
I have two rooms there

11
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:20,280
You can eat, cook and sleep.

12
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:22,520
There is a warehouse next to it with more than 100 square meters.

13
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:23,840
This yard is even bigger

14
00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:26,000
3,000 yuan a month, uncle

15
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Can it be more convenient?

16
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,080
My brother Xiao comes from the countryside.

17
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:29,200
It’s not easy at home

18
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:30,720
Until now, I still don’t have a place to stay.

19
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:32,880
Don’t worry, can you give us a cheaper price?

20
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:35,200
We will definitely take care of your yard

21
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,240
I come from the countryside

22
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:37,280
It’s not easy at home either

23
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:39,040
And I just came out not long ago

24
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:40,480
Can you make it cheaper for me?

25
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:41,520
young man

26
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:43,720
I didn't mean to ask for such a high price.

27
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:45,640
But the price is the same around us.

28
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:46,720
If I'm too cheap

29
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:48,360
People still have to say that I sabotaged the market.

30
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:49,400
Otherwise this is the case

31
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:50,560
I'll give you 300 yuan off

32
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:52,360
2700 a month is fine

33
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:53,760
2700 is 2700

34
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:56,120
But my brother Xiao has just started working and doesn’t have that much money.

35
00:00:56,120 --> 00:00:57,680
Can you just pay one month's rent first?
